      <p begin="01:02.820" end="01:06.690" ttm:agent="v1">Can find me under ride or die inside that dictionary</p>
      <p begin="01:06.690" end="01:10.350" ttm:agent="v1">Babe, uh-huh, they like it, it's simple as that</p>
      <p begin="01:10.350" end="01:14.320" ttm:agent="v1">That's right, uh-huh, they like it, they keep coming back</p>
